    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SporeBorne is a top-down, action hack-and-slash game where you play as an estranged mutation of a fungus infesting the planet H311. Embark on a journey, slashing through your enemies, growing more powerful, and uncovering abilities as you traverse this planet's infested land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action- packed slashing!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SporeBorne, you jump in to explore the infested land of planet H311 in our new top-down, action hack-and-slash game! Slash your way through foes and discover new abilities to downright <strong>ANNIHILATE\u00a0</strong>them! Experience the riveting and enchanting world of H311 via It's stunning visuals accompanied By an unnerving and wild atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to give you a challenging but fun gaming experience paired with a visual style and world that immerses you into its depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Different Abilities!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Different Enemies</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large Play Area!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lots of fun!</strong></p></li></ul>",
